        "jsCode": "// Fan the rows[] array from the List call into one item per row so the\n// Delete node below runs once per row (n8n runs most nodes once per input item).\nconst rows = $json.rows || [];\nreturn rows.map((r) => ({ json: { id: r.$id } }));"
      },
